    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated within the established Steeple Court development, this three-bedroom townhouse presents an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking a property with potential in a convenient city location.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, living room with balcony access, fitted kitchen, three bedrooms, and a family bathroom. While the property would benefit from refurbishment and modernisation throughout, it offers a solid foundation for a first-time buyer, investor, or anyone looking to add value through improvement works.\n\nSteeple Court enjoys a highly convenient location within easy reach of Kilkenny City Centre and a wide range of amenities including shops, schools, cafés, restaurants, and leisure facilities. The development has long been popular with both owner-occupiers and investors due to its accessibility and strong rental demand.\n\nThis property offers an opportunity to acquire a home in a sought-after location and create a living space tailored to individual requirements.\n\nACCOMODATION\n\nEntrance Hall - Bright and welcoming entrance hall featuring attractive laminated flooring throughout.\n\nKitchen - Modern kitchen fitted with laminated flooring and a range of integrated appliances, offering both practicality and style.\n\nLiving Room - Spacious living room with laminated flooring, a feature fireplace with mantelpiece, and direct access to a private balcony, creating a comfortable space for relaxation and entertaining.\n\nFirst Floor\n\nBedroom 1 - Single bedroom suitable for use as a home office or study, complete with carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - Well-proportioned double bedroom with carpet flooring and a built-in wardrobe providing excellent storage.\n\nMain Bathroom - Family bathroom finished with laminated flooring and fitted with a classic white suite comprising WC, wash hand basin, and shower.\n\nBedroom 3 - Large double bedroom featuring carpet flooring and a built-in wardrobe, offering ample space and storage.\n\n*Disclaimer - photos have been edited using AI to enhance or brighten the image*"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Two minute walk to Kilkenny City center.</li><li> Three-bedroom townhouse.</li><li> Living room with balcony access.</li><li> Located at the heart of Kilkenny City Centre and walking distance to all its amenities, café's, tourist attractions and shops.</li><li> Excellent potential to add value.</li><li> Suitable for first-time buyers and investors.</li><li> Strong rental potential following upgrade works.</ul>"
      },
